# organicVibes / indie-folk: 25 hooks for intimate indie-folk and chamber-pop songs (8 verses, 6 pre-choruses,
# 7 choruses, 4 bridges). Dorian (Am-D) and Mixolydian (C-Bb) colour, sus2/sus4 chords, held drone notes over moving
# chords, 3+5 bar phrasing, stepwise unison lines for gang-vocal choruses.

